        }
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Shree Shyam Small Growth Foundation"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Shree Shyam Small Growth Foundation (\"the Foundation\", \"we\", \"our\", or \"us\") is committed to protecting the privacy and personal information of our members, beneficiaries, donors, website visitors, and other stakeholders. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, store, and protect your information when you use our website or services.",
          "html": "Shree Shyam Small Growth Foundation (\"the Foundation\", \"we\", \"our\", or \"us\") is\n                    committed to protecting the privacy and personal information of our members, beneficiaries,\n                    donors, website visitors, and other stakeholders. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect,\n                    use, store, and protect your information when you use our website or services."
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "rows": [
            [
              {
                "header": true,
                "text": "Information We Collect :"
              },
              {
                "header": false,
                "text": "Personal Information :- Full Name, Father's/Husband Name, DOB, Gender, Mobile No., Residential Address, Identity Document, Bank Account Details, Membership Details, Loan or Financial Assistance application information (if applicable)\nWebsite Information :- IP Address, Browser Type, Device Information, Cookies and website usage data"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "header": true,
                "text": "How We Use Your Information :"
              },
              {
                "header": false,
                "text": "Process membership applications.\nRespond to enquiries and provide customer support.\nAdminister Foundation programs and services.\nCommunicate important updates and announcements.\nImprove our website and user experience.\nMaintain records required by applicable laws.\nPrevent fraud and protect the security of our services."
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "header": true,
                "text": "Information Sharing :"
              },
              {
                "header": false,
                "text": "We do not sell or rent your personal information.\nYour information may be shared only:-\nWith your consent.\nWhen required by applicable law or a lawful request from a government authority.\nWith trusted service providers who assist us in operating our services and who are required to protect your information.\nTo protect the legal rights, safety, or security of the Foundation or others"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "header": true,
                "text": "Data Security:"
              },
              {
                "header": false,
                "text": "We take reasonable administrative, technical, and organizational measures to protect personal information against unauthorized access, disclosure, alteration, or destruction. While we work to safeguard your data, no method of electronic storage or internet transmission can be guaranteed to be completely secure."
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "header": true,
                "text": "Cookies :"
              },
              {
                "header": false,
                "text": "Our website may use cookies to:\nImprove website functionality.\nRemember user preferences.\nAnalyze website traffic.\nEnhance the browsing experience.\nYou may disable cookies through your browser settings, although some website features may not function properly."
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "header": true,
                "text": "Your Rights :"
              },
              {
                "header": false,
                "text": "Subject to applicable law, you may have the right to :\nAccess your personal information.\nRequest correction of inaccurate information.\nRequest deletion of information where legally permitted.\nWithdraw consent where processing is based on consent.\nContact us with privacy-related concerns."
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "header": true,
                "text": "Third-Party Services :"
              },
              {
                "header": false,
                "text": "Our website may include links to third-party websites or services. We are not responsible for the privacy practices or content of those external websites. We encourage you to review their privacy policies before providing personal information."
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "header": true,
                "text": "Children's Privacy :"
              },
              {
                "header": false,
                "text": "Our services are not intended for children under 18 years of age unless participation is permitted with the consent of a parent or legal guardian and in accordance with applicable laws."
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "header": true,
                "text": "Changes to This Privacy Policy"
              },
              {
                "header": false,
                "text": "We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be published on this page along with the revised effective date."
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "header": true,
                "text": "Contact Us :"
              },
              {
                "header": false,
                "text": "Shree Shyam Small Growth Foundation\nManaging Director: Saurav Prakash\nOffice Address: Near Chini Mill Road, In Front of Pani Tanki, Shambu Sah Building Near Transformer, Bariyarpur, Motihari, Bihar – 845401"
              }
            ]
          ]
        }
      ],
